    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1158-a8">

                <pb facs="1239" n="1143" xml:id="pg1143"/>

                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States of Venezuela,<lb/>General Secretary’s
                                Office</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Ciudad
                            Bolivar</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1898-05-09"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">May 9,
                    1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#center">[Eighty-seventh and fortieth.]</p>
                <p>Gen. Emilio Antonio Santo-domingo will appear at the office of the
                    Secretary-General to-day at 3 p.m. to testify in a case of a political
                    nature.</p>
                <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">R. Contasti Laveaux</hi>,<lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">The Secretary-General.</hi></p>
                <p>Returned summoned.</p>
                <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ciudad Bolivar</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">May 15, 1898.</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#center">[Eighty-seventh and fortieth.]</p>
                <p>True copy of the original.</p>
                <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">R. Contasti Laveaux</hi>,<lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">The Secretary-General.</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ministry of Foreign
                        Affairs,<lb/>Department of Public Exterior Law</hi>,<lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">Caracas, June 6, 1898</hi>.</p>
                <p>True copy of the original process forwarded by the ministry of interior.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Manuel Fombona Palacio</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">The Director.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
